English summary (the Russian text prevails):
LocalCode is proprietary software licensed, not sold. One license covers the
number of computers stated in the purchased plan. The trial is for evaluation;
afterwards AI features require a valid signed key (editor, files and git remain
usable). You may not redistribute, resell, sublicense or publish keys, nor remove
or bypass the license or integrity checks. Editing the look (CSS), your own files
and settings is allowed, as is security research with responsible disclosure.
The app runs locally and verifies licenses offline. Provided "as is" without
warranties; liability is limited to the amount paid in the last 12 months.
